*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.
