==Strategy==
Due to the presence of the Aku Altar, it is highly recommended you complete the Aku Realms before attempting this stage

Despite how intimidating this stage may be, its strategy remains similiar to the previous 2 stages: Stack [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon Cat]] in Infernal Tyrant Nyandam's blindspot whilst making sure he never advances, however additional units are needed to deal with his support.

Elder Sloth will be providing an annoying backliner to go with Infernal Tyrant Nyandam so take your best units for bursting him down to remove him from the field as fast as possible. Aku Gory will be shredding through your meatshields, threatening to possibly destroying your Manic King Dragon Cat stack, so units like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] can be good for holding him off.
Condemned Peng & Devil Wife have dangerous unavoidable Death Surges that can possibly kill a lot of the units hiding in Infernal Tyrant Nyandam's blindspot, but an upside is that Devil Wife provides much needed cash. If a Death Surge does kill a lot of your units, don't despair as you can easily rebuild the stack.

Due to Infernal Tyrant Nyandam's blindspot from 401~499 Range, any and all units that can safely fit there (and have to the move speed to not be knocked back by his last 2 Multi-hits' [[Toxic]] before they can even get into his blindspot) work extremely well.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Urs & Fenrir (Special Cat)|Awakened Urs]]: Can provide good DPS, though they are quite fragile and may need to be timed.
*[[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]]: Can be used if all other options are unavailiable due to her lackluster DPS compared to the other options.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Chronos]]: Can [[Freeze]] every enemy, including Nyandam himself.
*[[Wolfchild Deale (Uber Rare Cat)|Jester Queen Deale]]: Has fantastic DPS for her Range but low burst damage, keep her alive.
*[[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Lord Gao]]: Has great bulk, range and DPS and can survive a few surges.
*[[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Sunrise Sirius]]: Similar to Gao, but trades range and some damage for other immunities, notably Toxic. Can also hit the backline with [[Long Distance]].
*[[Kenshin Himura (Uber Rare Cat)|Kenshin Himura]]: Has high DPS against Aku and [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immunity]].
*[[Mighty Morta-Loncha (Uber Rare Cat) |Grandiose Gunhauzer]]: Can confortably approach the Boss with [[Immune to Toxic|Toxic Immunity]] and can Freeze all Akus, including Nyandam, for an incredible 5 Seconds, creating very good synergy with your fast units. Also clears peons with their [[Explosion]]s, and they are Surge Immune for Condemned Peng.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: He stands perfectly in Nyandam's blindspot and his wave is a powerful 214k damage nuke, he can survive 2 hits from Nyandam's second/third hit.
*[[Summoner Satoru (Uber Rare Cat)|Devil Hunter Satoru]]: He provides amazing Crowd-Control for most Aku enemies here, and stands at a comfortable range in between Nyandam's first blind spot.
*[[Amakusa Shiro (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Amakusa]]: Can get full value out of his Multi-Hit thanks to Nyandam's low stagger counter.

